  "HOLD every worm as requiring a vulnerability, every virus as requiring a literal executable file or user click, and autonomous propagation as exclusive of deceptive delivery or ransomware payloads. Here automatic network exploitation is explicitly supplied. Host content includes more than executable files; blended malware can combine traits. Current feedback treats ransomware as payload rather than a mutually exclusive propagation category. Correlate with m125 definition without independent evidence or difficulty calibration. No exploit, infection count, propagation, patching or containment is measured.",
