  "HOLD every ransomware campaign as encrypting data, payment as guaranteeing recovery, cryptocurrency as mandatory, or encryption alone as extortion. Here both encryption and payment demand are stipulated. Collection, concealment and advertising can coexist; the offered defining behavior is extortion linked to encryption. Correlate closely with m256, which is a definition rather than another independently varied recovery scenario. No victim files, payment, decryption key, actor, ransom negotiation or restored data are observed.",
  "HOLD a familiar filename or unusual writable path alone as confirmed malicious masquerading, all legitimate binaries as having a single fixed path, or signature/hash checks as guaranteed proof of safety. The supplied EDR alert suggests a hypothesis; current main feedback requires additional provenance. No rights increase, library-loading abuse or credential extraction is supplied. The ATT&CK label is context, not assessed ID recall or proof of an actor. Correlate with m131/m441/m442 indicator-hypothesis limits and preserve m258 purpose-scope hold. No file, signature, hash, process history or incident is inspected.",
